OpenEndpointSecurity (oes) examples
===================================

Example clients for the oes(4) framework and DTrace scripts for the "oes"
SDT provider.  See oes(4) and liboes(3).

  oesd.c          - reference monitoring daemon
  oeslogger.c     - JSON event logger; configurable noise mutes and descendant scope
  vendor_client.c - example third-party client
  dtrace/*.d      - DTrace scripts for the oes provider (auth, cache, events)
